Package: yt-downloader
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: likelystudying <likelystudying@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Recommends: zenity, xdg-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/likelystudying/yt_downloader
Description: helper app for the YT Downloader browser extension
 Lets the YT Downloader extension download YouTube videos (MP4) and audio
 (MP3) from Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge or Brave. It runs yt-dlp, FFmpeg
 and Deno, which it downloads to ~/.local/share/YT Downloader on first use.
 Browsers installed as Snap or Flatpak packages can't run helper apps.
